X-WR-TIMEZONE:Europe/Berlin
X-WR-CALDESC:One event with a recurrence rule RFC 5545 does not allow, one we
 ekly event that must still import.
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260706T090000Z
DTEND:20260706T100000Z
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY;BYMONTH=13
DTSTAMP:20260601T120000Z
UID:broken-rule@open-source-event-calendar.test
CREATED:20260601T120000Z
DESCRIPTION:Month 13 does not exist. iCalcreator passes it through\, php-r
 rule rejects it.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260601T120000Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Event with an invalid repeat rule
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260707T090000Z
DTEND:20260707T100000Z
RRULE:FREQ=WEEKLY;COUNT=3
